  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Sida will a project regarding masters studies scholarships for students from thirteen ODA countries in Eastern Europe(incliding the Western Balkans) and Central Asien. The scholarships will cover the trip to Sweden as well as a monthly grant of SEK 8000 per student during the period of the masters studies (1-2 years). The executing Swedish party in this project is the Swedish Institute(SI)</narrative>
